{"story":{"group_1":[{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"bg":"bg_adv_24014.jpg","bgm":"stop","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"bgm":"bgm03_story02","nameNarration":"命","narration":"小帆奈很聪明@总是能接二连三地解明@我没有注意到的事","narrationBg":"bg_adv_24014.jpg","narrationEffect":"in","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"narration":"推断出我的能让他人言听计从的魔法…@不对，暗示魔法也能对自己使用的@也是小帆奈"},{"narration":"对此我非常感谢"},{"narration":"因为，本来只存在于想象中的@温柔和睦的双亲和快乐的学校生活…"},{"narration":"通过向自己施加暗示@我就能相信这一切都是真正的@都是实际存在的"},{"autoTurnLast":0.5,"bg":"bg_adv_21293.jpg","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":104401,"motion":0,"pos":1}],"narrationEffect":"out","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"chara":[{"id":104401,"motion":200}],"nameCenter":"命","textCenter":"妈妈，爸爸@我回来了！","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":104401,"motion":0}],"nameCenter":"命","textCenter":"…诶，没人在家…？"},{"chara":[{"eyeClose":1,"id":104401,"lipSynch":0,"motion":1}],"nameCenter":"命","textCenter":"…………"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"chara":[{"eyeClose":0,"id":104401}]},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":104401}],"nameCenter":"命","textCenter":"啊…对了…这样啊…@全部都是暗示来着…"},{"nameNarration":"命","narration":"嘛，虽然一回到家被迫直面现实@暗示就会解开，非常痛苦…","narrationBg":"bg_adv_21293.jpg","narrationEffect":"in"},{"narration":"但只要再次施加暗示@我就能重新变得幸福@仅仅如此就已经足够了"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"bg":"bg_adv_21221.jpg","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":104401,"motion":0,"pos":0},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":301801,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"narrationEffect":"out","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"nameNarration":"命","narration":"这一天@我也在对自己施加暗示之后出门了…","narrationBg":"bg_adv_21221.jpg","narrationEffect":"in","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"narration":"但那是一次失败"},{"chara":[{"id":104401,"motion":100}],"nameLeft":"命","narrationEffect":"out","textLeft":"啊，不好@我差不多得回家了"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":301801,"motion":400}],"nameRight":"更纱帆奈","textRight":"这么快？"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":1,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":104401,"motion":300}],"nameLeft":"命","textLeft":"对不起，最近因为回家太晚@我经常被爸妈说…"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":301801,"motion":300}],"nameRight":"更纱帆奈","textRight":"啊…"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"chara":[{"eyeClose":0,"id":104401}]},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":104401,"motion":200}],"nameLeft":"命","textLeft":"不是不是！@倒也没有被骂！"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":104401,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"命","textLeft":"只是因为爸爸太爱操心了@总是担心我被不好的人缠上"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_000.exp3.json","id":301801,"motion":200}],"nameRight":"更纱帆奈","textRight":"这不是已经@有不好的人缠上你了吗？"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":104401,"motion":1}],"nameLeft":"命","textLeft":"小帆奈才不算啦~"},{"chara":[{"id":104401}],"nameLeft":"命","textLeft":"但如果爸爸妈妈@知道了小帆奈的事情"},{"chara":[{"id":104401}],"nameLeft":"命","textLeft":"就不会再说什么了吧@因为他们都很明事理的"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":301801,"motion":1}],"nameRight":"更纱帆奈","textRight":"哼——…@那，要不我去打声招呼？"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":104401,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"命","textLeft":"诶，那也太不好意思了"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_000.exp3.json","id":301801}],"nameRight":"更纱帆奈","textRight":"不…@毕竟还要顾及魔女…"},{"chara":[{"id":301801,"motion":0}],"nameRight":"更纱帆奈","textRight":"我希望濑奈@能以更自由的状态活动"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":104401,"motion":100}],"nameLeft":"命","textLeft":"…但、但是…那可是我家哦？@你真的愿意特意来一趟吗？"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":301801,"motion":100}],"nameRight":"更纱帆奈","textRight":"为什么要怀疑这个…？@濑奈的朋友不是很多吗？"},{"chara":[{"id":301801},{"id":104401,"motion":0}],"nameRight":"更纱帆奈","textRight":"这应该是常有的事吧？"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_000.exp3.json","id":301801,"motion":1}],"nameRight":"更纱帆奈","textRight":"…虽然我也不是很清楚"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":104401,"motion":400}],"nameLeft":"命","textLeft":"好、好厉害…这还是第一次@有朋友来我家里…！"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":301801}],"nameRight":"更纱帆奈","textRight":"第一次…？"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":104401,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"命","textLeft":"啊，但今天已经说好了@我会在外面吃饭，可以等下次吗？"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":301801,"motion":0}],"nameRight":"更纱帆奈","textRight":"倒是可以…"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":104401,"motion":200}],"nameLeft":"命","textLeft":"是真的哦？@我不会反悔的！"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":301801,"motion":200}],"nameRight":"更纱帆奈","textRight":"…为什么要那么执着…？"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":104401,"motion":100}],"nameLeft":"命","textLeft":"因为我很高兴嘛"},{"chara":[{"id":104401,"motion":1}],"nameLeft":"命","textLeft":"只是想到@最重要的小帆奈愿意来我家"},{"chara":[{"eyeClose":1,"id":104401}],"nameLeft":"命","textLeft":"我就超级开心…！"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_000.exp3.json","id":301801,"motion":1}],"nameRight":"更纱帆奈","textRight":"好啦，我知道了…@要到门禁时间了吧？快回去吧"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"chara":[{"eyeClose":0,"id":104401}]},{"chara":[{"id":104401,"motion":200}],"nameLeft":"命","textLeft":"嗯，明天见！@到时候一定要把日期定下来！"},{"autoTurnLast":1.2,"bg":"bg_adv_21293.jpg","bgm":"stop","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":104401,"motion":0,"pos":1}],"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"bgm":"bgm03_story06","chara":[{"id":104401,"motion":300}],"nameCenter":"命","textCenter":"不，怎么能定下来啊…","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"chara":[{"id":104401,"motion":0}],"nameNarration":"命","narration":"回到家里，暗示解开之后@我才为时已晚地注意到@自己许下了不得了的约定","narrationBg":"bg_adv_21293.jpg","narrationEffect":"in"},{"chara":[{"id":104401,"motion":100}],"nameCenter":"命","narrationEffect":"out","textCenter":"怎、怎么办…"},{"nameNarration":"命","narration":"如果坦白自己在说谎@可能会被小帆奈讨厌…@想到这里，我的胸口就绞痛欲裂","narrationBg":"bg_adv_21293.jpg","narrationEffect":"in"},{"chara":[{"eyeClose":1,"id":104401,"motion":1}],"narration":"那也是小帆奈成为了@对我而言无比重要的存在的证据"},{"chara":[{"eyeClose":1,"id":104401}],"nameCenter":"命","narrationEffect":"out","textCenter":"但也没办法蒙混过关…"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"bg":"black","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":800900,"motion":0,"pos":0},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":800800,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"nameNarration":"命","narration":"对了，还有那两个人呢","narrationBg":"narration","narrationCoverOpacity":160,"narrationEffect":"in","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"bg":"bg_adv_21293.jpg","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_000.exp3.json","id":104401,"motion":0,"pos":1}],"narrationEffect":"out","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"chara":[{"id":104401}],"nameCenter":"命","textCenter":"只要再利用一次那两个人…","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"nameNarration":"命","narration":"只要把小帆奈带去曾经被我施加过暗示，@以为我是他们女儿的那两个人家里@就能蒙混过关…","narrationBg":"bg_adv_21293.jpg","narrationEffect":"in"},{"narration":"只有这个办法了@因为就算说谎，我也不想暴露嘛"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":104401,"motion":400}],"nameCenter":"命","narrationEffect":"out","textCenter":"…得赶紧开始准备了"},{"autoTurnLast":2,"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"}]},"version":3}